# FEAT specs are internal planning docs — never public. Kept only in the
# local main worktree. Whole docs/specs/ tree excluded (incl. INDEX.md /
# README.md navigation), consistent with docs/backlog/. NOTE: 23 specs
# were tracked + pushed before this rule; they remain in public git
# history until a deliberate history-rewrite purge — see CLAUDE.md
# Public-Repo-Hygiene.
docs/specs/

# Internal triage workflow (RepoLens findings, verdicts, per-release audits)
#
# HARD RULE: RepoLens findings and any audit-tool output NEVER land in this
# repo. Always output to an absolute path under ~/cruxcoach-internal-archive/
# or similar — see CLAUDE.md "RepoLens and other audit tools" for the policy.
# The patterns below are a defence-in-depth backstop, not the primary control.
docs/specs/*/triage/
tools/triage/
scripts/repolens-*.sh

# RepoLens output shapes (file-name-based backstop across the whole tree)
findings.jsonl
verdicts.jsonl
**/findings.jsonl
**/verdicts.jsonl
repolens-out/
**/repolens-out/
**/repolens-run-*/
**/.repolens/

